000B88  1               ;
000B88  1               ; ALL "RESERVED" WORDS ARE TRANSLATED INTO SINGLE
000B88  1               ; BYTES WITH THE MSB ON. THIS SAVES SPACE AND TIME
000B88  1               ; BY ALLOWING FOR TABLE DISPATCH DURING EXECUTION.
000B88  1               ; THEREFORE ALL STATEMENTS APPEAR TOGETHER IN THE
000B88  1               ; RESERVED WORD LIST IN THE SAME ORDER THEY
000B88  1               ; APPEAR IN STMDSP.
000B88  1               ;
000B88  1               ;THE AMOUNT TO OFFSET THE LOW BYTE
