000C14  1               ;
000C14  1               ; FNDLIN SEARCHES THE PROGRAM TEXT FOR THE LINE
000C14  1               ; WHOSE NUMBER IS PASSED IN "LINNUM".
000C14  1               ; THERE ARE TWO POSSIBLE RETURNS:
000C14  1               ;
000C14  1               ;	1) CARRY SET.
000C14  1               ;	   LOWTR POINTS TO THE LINK FIELD IN THE LINE
000C14  1               ;	   WHICH IS THE ONE SEARCHED FOR.
000C14  1               ;
000C14  1               ;	2) CARRY NOT SET.
000C14  1               ;	   LINE NOT FOUND. [LOWTR] POINTS TO THE LINE IN THE
000C14  1               ;	   PROGRAM GREATER THAN THE ONE SOUGHT AFTER.
000C14  1               ;
