000D29  1               ; PAGE
000D29  1               ; SUBTTL THE "FOR" STATEMENT.
000D29  1               ;
000D29  1               ; A "FOR" ENTRY ON THE STACK HAS THE FOLLOWING FORMAT:
000D29  1               ;
000D29  1               ; LOW ADDRESS
000D29  1               ;	TOKEN (FORTK) 1 BYTE
000D29  1               ;	A POINTER TO THE LOOP VARIABLE 2 BYTES
000D29  1               ;	THE STEP 4+ADDPRC BYTES
000D29  1               ;	A BYTE REFLECTING THE SIGN OF THE INCREMENT 1 BYTE
000D29  1               ;	THE UPPER VALUE 4+ADDPRC BYTES
000D29  1               ;	THE LINE NUMBER OF THE "FOR" STATEMENT 2 BYTES
000D29  1               ;	A TEXT POINTER INTO THE "FOR" STATEMENT 2 BYTES
000D29  1               ; HIGH ADDRESS
000D29  1               ;
000D29  1               ; TOTAL 16+2*ADDPRC BYTES.
000D29  1               ;
000D29  1               
