001348  1               ;
001348  1               ; THE FORMULA EVALUATOR STARTS WITH
001348  1               ; [TXTPTR] POINTING TO THE FIRST CHARACTER OF THE FORMULA.
001348  1               ; AT THE END [TXTPTR] POINTS TO THE TERMINATOR.
001348  1               ; THE RESULT IS LEFT IN THE FAC.
001348  1               ; ON RETURN [A] DOES NOT REFLECT THE TERMINATOR.
001348  1               ;
001348  1               ; THE FORMULA EVALUATOR USES THE OPERATOR LIST (OPTAB)
001348  1               ; TO DETERMINE PRECEDENCE AND DISPATCH ADDRESSES FOR
001348  1               ; EACH OPERATOR.
001348  1               ; A TEMPORARY RESULT ON THE STACK HAS THE FOLLOWING FORMAT.
001348  1               ;	THE ADDRESS OF THE OPERATOR ROUTINE.
001348  1               ;	THE FLOATING POINT TEMPORARY RESULT.
001348  1               ;	THE PRECEDENCE OF THE OPERATOR.
001348  1               ;
001348  1  A6 B9        FRMEVL: LDX TXTPTR
