00136B  1  90 17        BCC ENDREL ;NO. RELATIONS ALL THROUGH.
00136D  1  C9 02        CMP #LESSTK-GREATK+1 ;REALLY RELATIONAL?
00136F  1  B0 13        BCS ENDREL ;NO -- JUST BIG.
001371  1  C9 01        CMP #1 ;RESET CARRY FOR ZERO ONLY.
001373  1  2A           ROL ;0 TO 1, 1 TO 2, 2 TO 4.
001374  1  49 01        EOR #1
001376  1  45 8C        EOR OPMASK ;BRING IN THE OLD BITS.
001378  1  C5 8C        CMP OPMASK ;MAKE SURE THE NEW MASK IS BIGGER.
00137A  1  90 61        BCC SNERR5 ;SYNTAX ERROR. BECAUSE TWO OF THE SAME.
