0015AC  1               ; THE "DIM" CODE SETS [DIMFLG] AND THEN FALLS INTO THE VARIABLE SEARCH
0015AC  1               ; ROUTINE, WHICH LOOKS AT DIMFLG AT THREE DIFFERENT POINTS.
0015AC  1               ;	1) IF AN ENTRY IS FOUND, "DIMFLG" BEING ON INDICATES
0015AC  1               ;		A "DOUBLY" DIMENSIONED VARIABLE.
0015AC  1               ;	2) WHEN A NEW ENTRY IS BEING BUILT "DIMFLG" BEING ON
0015AC  1               ;		INDICTAES THE INDICES SHOULD BE USED FOR THE
0015AC  1               ;		SIZE OF EACH INDEX. OTHERWISE THE DEFAULT OF TEN
0015AC  1               ;		IS USED.
0015AC  1               ;	3) WHEN THE BUILD ENTRY CODE FINISHES, ONLY IF "DIMFLG" IS OFF
0015AC  1               ;		WILL INDEXING BE DONE.
