00228B  1  24 9E        BIT DPTFLG
00228D  1  10 02        BPL FINDG1
00228F  1  E6 9C        INC DECCNT
002291  1  20 FF 1F     FINDG1: JSR MUL10
002294  1  68           PLA ;GET IT BACK.
002295  1  38           SEC
