002521  1               ; SUBTTL	POLYNOMIAL EVALUATOR AND THE RANDOM NUMBER GENERATOR.
002521  1               ;EVALUATE P(X^2)*X
002521  1               ;POINTER TO DEGREE IS IN [Y,A].
002521  1               ;THE CONSTANTS FOLLOW THE DEGREE.
002521  1               ;FOR X=FAC, COMPUTE:
002521  1               ; C0*X+C1*X^3+C2*X^5+C3*X^7+...+C(N)*X^(2*N+1)
002521  1               POLYX: ;RETAIN POLYNOMIAL POINTER FOR LATER.
002521  1  85 B0        STA POLYPT
002523  1  84 B1        STY POLYPT+1
