002537  1               ;POLYNOMIAL EVALUATOR.
002537  1               ;POINTER TO DEGREE IS IN [Y,A].
002537  1               ;COMPUTE:
002537  1               ; C0+C1*X+C2*X^2+C3*X^3+C4*X^4+...+C(N-1)*X^(N-1)+C(N)*X^N.
002537  1               POLY:
002537  1  85 B0        STA POLYPT
002539  1  84 B1        STY POLYPT+1
