00256B  1               ;PSUEDO-RANDOM NUMBER GENERATOR.
00256B  1               ;IF ARG=0, THE LAST RANDOM NUMBER GENERATED IS RETURNED.
00256B  1               ;IF ARG .LT. 0, A NEW SEQUENCE OF RANDOM NUMBERS IS
00256B  1               ;STARTED USING THE ARGUMENT.
00256B  1               ;   TO FORM THE NEXT RANDOM NUMBER IN THE SEQUENCE,
00256B  1               ;MULTIPLY THE PREVIOUS RANDOM NUMBER BY A RANDOM CONSTANT
00256B  1               ;AND ADD IN ANOTHER RANDOM CONSTANT. THE THEN HO
00256B  1               ;AND LO BYTES ARE SWITCHED, THE EXPONENT IS PUT WHERE
00256B  1               ;IT WILL BE SHIFTED IN BY NORMAL, AND THE EXPONENT IN THE FAC
00256B  1               ;IS SET TO 200 SO THE RESULT WILL BE LESS THAN 1. THIS
00256B  1               ;IS THEN NORMALIZED AND SAVED FOR THE NEXT TIME.
00256B  1               ;THE HO AND LOW BYTES WERE SWITCHED SO THERE WILL BE A
00256B  1               ;RANDOM CHANCE OF GETTING A NUMBER LESS THAN OR GREATER
00256B  1               ;THAN .5 .
00256B  1               
